### GET dépôt existant
GET http://localhost:3000/api/depots/32 

### GET dépôt inexistant - erreur 404
GET http://localhost:3000/api/depots/999999

### POST créer un dépôt
POST http://localhost:3000/api/depots
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date_depot": "2026-09-03",
  "type": "boutique",
  "personne_id": 25
}

### POST dépôt - champs obligatoires manquants
POST http://localhost:3000/api/depots
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date_depot": "2026-09-03",
  "type": "boutique"
}

### POST dépôt - type invalide
POST http://localhost:3000/api/depots
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date_depot": "2026-09-03",
  "type": "n_importe_quoi",
  "personne_id": 25
}

### POST ajouter un objet à un dépôt
POST http://localhost:3000/api/depots/32/objets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "libelle": "Chaise test validation",
  "poids_kg": 4.5,
  "etat_arrivee": "bon_etat",
  "categorie_id": 1
}

### POST objet - poids invalide
POST http://localhost:3000/api/depots/32/objets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "libelle": "Chaise test validation",
  "poids_kg": "4.5",
  "etat_arrivee": "bon_etat",
  "categorie_id": 1
}

### POST objet - enum invalide
POST http://localhost:3000/api/depots/32/objets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "libelle": "Chaise test validation",
  "poids_kg": 4.5,
  "etat_arrivee": "n_importe_quoi",
  "categorie_id": 1
}

### POST objet - champs obligatoires manquants
POST http://localhost:3000/api/depots/32/objets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "libelle": "Chaise test validation",
  "poids_kg": 4.5
}